he test name, ID and link from TestRail:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Notes/Photos/Videos:** Any additional supporting documentation\n\n[Screencast from 19-09-23 01_16_24 AM IST.webm](https://github.com/Expensify/App/assets/43996225/e31a1536-6b6e-4764-8950-dc9af25fc38c)\n\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @Someshwar-Tripathi\n**Slack conversation:** https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C049HHMV9SM/p1695047398155859\n\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~012d86d9fa187b7292</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 1708808891588886528</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2023-10-02</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\nAssignee: johncschuster\nTime released: 2023-10-06 19:44 PM", 'new_chat_members': [], 'chat': {'first_name': 'Robel', 'id': 5347094985, 'username': 'ZeMicah', 'type': 'private'}, 'group_chat_created': False, 'reply_markup': {'inline_keyboard': [[{'text': 'View Issue', 'url': 'https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/28599'}]]}, 'new_chat_photo': [], 'channel_chat_created': False, 'from': {'first_name': 'IssueNotified', 'id': 6685183482, 'is_bot': True, 'username': 'IssueNotifiedBot'}}
